etermined from the avowal alone.\",\"recognised_work\":false,\"recognition_note\":\"No work is identifiable from the supplied expression alone.\",\"limitations\":\"There are no source blocks or contextual details. Relationship history, sincerity, emotional circumstances, intended implications, and uptake therefore remain unknown.\"}"
